OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous and violent' rapist
OL,4,Ajailed for 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "dangerous and violent" man has been
OL,7,Fsentenced to 20 years in prison for a
OL,8,Fstring of rapes and assaults.
OL,10,FAaron Purewal, 32, of no fixed abode,
OL,11,Fwas found guilty of 10 charges against
OL,12,Fa single victim after an earlier trial
OL,13,Fat Bradford Crown Court and, on Monday,
OL,14,Fwas sentenced to the prison term and a
OL,15,Ffurther five years on licence.
OL,17,FPurewal's victim ` who cannot be named
OL,18,Ffor legal reasons ` said she was "still
OL,19,Ftrying to understand who I am after
OL,20,Fwhat happened".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
